{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01646","headline":"杂曲歌辞 羽林行 · 鲍溶","name":"杂曲歌辞 羽林行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝出羽林宫，入参云台议。\n独请万里行，不奏和亲事。\n君王重年少，深纳开边利。\n宝马雕玉鞍，一朝从万骑。\n煌煌都门外，祖帐光七贵。\n歌钟乐行军，云物惨别地。\n箫笳整部曲，幢盖动郊次。\n临风亲戚怀，满袖儿女泪。\n行行复何赠，长劒报恩字。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}